      <data key="d1">"小红 is the person who defined the good matrix problem and is involved in solving it."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who posed the problem of constructing a 3x3 determinant with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who requested the construction of a 3x3 determinant with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the student who defined the '好数组' problem and wrote the code that contains an error."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了好数组的条件，要求数组不是回文数组且修改恰好一个元素后变成回文数组。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who poses the problem of constructing a permutation with specific range constraints for each element."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who defined the problem of transforming a matrix into a good matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who defines the problem of transforming a matrix into a good matrix with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who needs the solution to determine the minimal cost for the bit operation problem."</data>
