      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Xiaohong is a person who defines the good matrix criteria and requires transforming a given matrix into a good matrix by swapping adjacent characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person attempting to solve the matrix transformation problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who defined the 'twin array' concept and posed the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who defined the '好数组' problem, specifying the criteria for a good array and the task to count valid subarrays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who requests the construction of a 3x3 determinant with specific conditions: each element’s absolute value ≥1, and the determinant’s value equals x."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who posed the problem of constructing a 3x3 determinant with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who has an array and wants to minimize its range by performing a specific operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who defines the good matrix problem and requires a solution to transform a given matrix into a good matrix using adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who defined the problem of transforming a matrix into a good matrix with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xiaohong is the person who defines the good matrix problem and provides the matrix to be transformed."</data>
